IMAPAccount stevens
Host 127.0.0.1
Port 1143
User dliu4@stevens.edu
Pass ""
AuthMechs LOGIN
TLSType None

IMAPStore stevens-remote
Account stevens

MaildirStore stevens-local
Subfolders Verbatim
Path ~/Mail/stevens/
Inbox ~/Mail/stevens/INBOX/

Channel stevens
Far :stevens-remote:
Near :stevens-local:
Patterns * # stevens/INBOX stevens/Archive stevens/Sent stevens/Junk
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

# Group o365-davmail
# Channel stevens-default
